  "description": "The Haro Bridgeport ST is equally at home on smooth pavement or fire road trails, featuring Rider-Optimized geometry to make sure you always get the most comfortable ride. Some of the key spec's on the Bridgeport ST include a 6061 aluminum frame, Shimano 2x8 drivetrain, SR Suntour NEX HLO suspension fork, mechanical disc brakes and a 700c wheel set with 38c width tires.\nHaro Solum Step-Through Dual Sport frame with Rider Optimized Geometry, mechanically-shaped alloy tubing with chainstay disc brake mount\nSR Suntour NEX HLO suspension fork with 63mm travel and hydraulic lockout\nShimano Tourney crankset, 46/30 gearing with sealed cartridge BB set\nShimano Altus rear derailleur\nAlloy 25mm rise, 31.8mm OD, 9° backsweep handlebar\nShimano Altus Rapidfire Plus shifters, 2x8-speed\nAlloy disc brake hubs with 700c alloy double wall rims\nMechanical disc brakes with 180mm F. and 160mm R. rotors",
